# Deny by default. The Dockerfile explicitly copies only the files below, so
# host credentials, editor/agent settings, .env files, and test artifacts cannot
# accidentally become part of a build layer.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!tsconfig.build.json
!tsup.config.ts
!README.md
!LICENSE
!SKILL.md

!src/
!src/**

!skills/
!skills/**

!assets/
!assets/blocks/
!assets/blocks/**
!assets/legacy-skill-hashes.json

# Single file, not the whole packaging/ directory: the `vnc` target needs this
# entrypoint in the build context, but the compose files beside it reference
# host secret paths and have no business in an image layer.
!packaging/vnc-entrypoint.sh
